WEBVTT

00:18:59.167 --> 00:19:03.917
so that you organize, activate,
proselytize, your company,

00:19:03.917 --> 00:19:08.003
your neighbors, youth, I think
are an incredibly powerful voice,

00:19:08.003 --> 00:19:09.383
and friends.

00:19:09.383 --> 00:19:10.383
HH: Yup.

00:19:10.383 --> 00:19:11.398
JD: You need to vote.

00:19:11.398 --> 00:19:12.413
HH: Yup.

00:19:12.413 --> 00:19:15.067
JD: You need to vote
like your life depends on it.

00:19:15.067 --> 00:19:18.367
So Hal, what does this all add up to?

00:19:18.367 --> 00:19:20.300
What's the takeaway?

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.933
HH: I'm an optimist, John.
I've seen this possible.

00:19:23.343 --> 00:19:25.637
I've seen when nations
decide to do great things,

00:19:25.637 --> 00:19:27.117
they can do great things.

00:19:27.117 --> 00:19:31.027
Think of America’s rural electrification
or the interstate highway system we built.